MTD	mzTab-profile	M+S
MTD	title	Sphingolipid Concentrations in Serum for Muscle Wasting in Cancer Cachexia (part-IX)
MTD	description	Sphingolipid Concentrations of Muscle Wasting in Cancer Cachexia. Serum samples from 10 control patients, 10 weight stable pancreatic cancer patients, and 10 pancreatic cancer patients with significant weight loss. Samples are divided evenly between males and females.
